[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7622.87, "timestamp": "02:07:02", "text": "男性 YouTuber，因为为什么？你为什么要这么做？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7625.109, "timestamp": "02:07:05", "text": "为什么你会……我的意思是通常情况下"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7629.589, "timestamp": "02:07:09", "text": "观众以男性为主。所以，我我我我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7632.069, "timestamp": "02:07:12", "text": "这会强烈暗示以下事实："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7633.669, "timestamp": "02:07:13", "text": "他们去那里是为了一些事情"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7635.589, "timestamp": "02:07:15", "text": "他们去是有特定原因的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7637.91, "timestamp": "02:07:17", "text": "原因在于……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7644.39, "timestamp": "02:07:24", "text": "嗯，大概是吧。但是，但是，但是如今它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7646.709, "timestamp": "02:07:26", "text": "确实存在一个巨大的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7648.95, "timestamp": "02:07:28", "text": "动态变化。雄性是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7652.55, "timestamp": "02:07:32", "text": "我也开始陆续走出去。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7655.79, "timestamp": "02:07:35", "text": "但我猜我不知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7658.87, "timestamp": "02:07:38", "text": "呃，我觉得总的来说，我不知道在哪里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7661.99, "timestamp": "02:07:41", "text": "就他们而言，YouTuber 目前的地位如何？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7664.069, "timestamp": "02:07:44", "text": "人气。他们肯定持有股份。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7666.95, "timestamp": "02:07:46", "text": "但我猜它不是YouTube游戏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7670.149, "timestamp": "02:07:50", "text": "已经转变为更贴近现实生活的风格。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7673.03, "timestamp": "02:07:53", "text": "你知道我的意思？就像现在这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7677.189, "timestamp": "02:07:57", "text": "是的，人们。比如挑战"}]